                <td bgcolor="#f0f0f0" width="20%" valign="top"><b>Rovo Project Business Description:</b></td>
                <td id="customfield_14248-178563-value" class="value" bgcolor="#ffffff" width="80%">      <p>This project delivers a barcode enhancement to automate the “Mailstop” process for returned mail across all 529 and ABLE plans, eliminating the need for manual indexing and repeat mail attempts. This enhancement drives significant operational cost savings and productivity improvements by reducing the volume of second-attempt mailers and freeing up employee time for higher-value tasks.</p>
  </td>
            </tr>
            </table>

    <br/>

    <table cellpadding="2" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" align="center">
    <tr>
        <td bgcolor="#bbbbbb" width="1%" nowrap align="center">
            &nbsp;<font color="#ffffff"><b>Description</b></font>&nbsp;
        </td>
        <td>&nbsp;</td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>As of March 2023, 55,000 pieces of returned mail are received by mail ops each year. Of these, 29,000 mail pieces are sent out for 2nd Attempt mailers. These attempts have drained resource time of employees as well as cost the organization an unnecessary expense. Eliminating the 2nd Attempt mailers can free up more value added time for employees and reduce costs for the organization. <br/>
We aim to reduce the 29,000 2nd Attempt Mailers to 0 by 12/31/2023.﻿</p>

<p>Dependency on O'Neil.</p>

<p>can operations (Kaden) help with testing so that offshore team can do the work? or</p>

<div class='table-wrap'>
<table class='confluenceTable'><tbody>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'>NPV - Cash Flow 5 Years</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>$63,923</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'>ROI</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>247%</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
</div>


<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="https://acscensus.aha.io/attachments/7325492718445102684/token/b5622035aac2ace472d105558cc1880c87e9a6d0e6f3ff3ee9e6827cc09b0a71.download?size=original" height="218.54058078927773" width="500" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>Discovery Call - 4/12/23</p>

<div class='table-wrap'>
<table class='confluenceTable'><tbody>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'><b>Discovery Call Questions/Answers:</b></td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>&nbsp;</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'>What is the problem we are trying to solve, in business terms, what is the ask? What is the scope of work?</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>As of March 2023, 55,000 pieces of returned mail are received by mail ops each year. Of these, 29,000 mail pieces are sent out for 2nd Attempt mailers. These attempts have drained resource time of employees as well as cost the organization an unnecessary expense. Eliminating the 2nd Attempt mailers can free up more value added time for employees and reduce costs for the organization.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'>What is the business value? Why are we doing this and how will it help the business goals?</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>We aim to reduce the 29,000 2nd Attempt Mailers to 0 by 12/31/2023.﻿</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'>Is there a workaround?</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>Currently manual work</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'>Is there similar functionality on a different plan?</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>No</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'>What is the <b>primary</b> Strategic Goal that you are trying to accomplish? Pick one: Revenue Growth, Regulatory/Compliance, Expense Reduction, Risk Mitigation, Contractual, Stability &amp; Scalability</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>Expense Reduction</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'>Is there a specific Strategic Client angle? Pick one: large profitable client relationship, upcoming client renewal, ongoing client contract negotiations, not applicable</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>N/A</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'>Is there a target quarter or target date, and if so what is the driver for the target? What will be the consequence if the target is not hit?</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>deliver before end of Oct to coincide with busy season</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'>Is there a risk of not completing: What is the impact/severity of the risk (High/Medium/Low)? What is the probability/likelihood the risk will be realized (High, Medium, Low)?</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>Medium - High</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'><b>AHA Scorecard:</b></td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>&nbsp;</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'><font color="#172B4D">What is the estimated net new revenue over a 5 year period directly related to implementing this feature? </font> <font color="#172B4D"> How did you get to this number? Provide additional details to support the estimate i.e. Net new assets estimate, Net new accounts, New contributions; </font></td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>$0</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'><font color="#242424">Will this lead to any estimated operational efficiencies or cost reduction, and if so please provide more details to quantify the impact? </font> i.e. # reduced call per week, # reduced processing transactions, # saved Service/Ops hours, # of IT hours, # reduced paper forms</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>Total: $98,780
<br class="atl-forced-newline" />
-Hard Cash Savings (EBITDA): $18,270 (1 year)
<br class="atl-forced-newline" />
-Soft Cash Savings (Productivity): $80,510 (1 year)
<br class="atl-forced-newline" />
Finance Rep Approved: Sam Butt
<br class="atl-forced-newline" />
See attached Initial ROI</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'>Will this impact client experience (end-client or stakeholders)? If yes provide details of the impact? (5 massive, 4, high, 3 medium, 2 low, 1 minimal).</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>&nbsp;</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'>Regulatory or contractual (1 no, 2 yes but flexible date, 3 yes with fixed date)</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>&nbsp;</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'><ul>
	<li>** <font color="#172B4D">If contractual, what are the specifics of the contractual agreement?</font></li>
</ul>
</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>No</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'><ul>
	<li>** <font color="#172B4D">If regulatory, what are the specifics of the regulation?</font></li>
</ul>
</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>&nbsp;</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'>Which plans will be impacted by the change over the course of a year? If not all plans, then list specific impacted plans.</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>All Plans</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'>Effort <em>-</em> <font color="#172B4D">Determine duration to complete the ask by a dedicated full team: Extra Small - under 2 days; Small - 1-2 sprints; Medium - 2-4 sprints; Large - 4-8 sprints; Extra Large - 8+ sprints.</font></td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>Combo of Kofax team (Dallas), Nigo -
<br class="atl-forced-newline" />
Adding barcode - Scrum Team effort - full team = 1 sprint</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'><b>Technical Considerations:</b></td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>&nbsp;</td>
</tr>
<tr>
